    {
      "id": 30618,
      "name": "Golpo",
      "slug": "golpo",
      "batch": "Summer 2025",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/golpo",
      "changed_fields": [
        "long_description"
      ],
      "changes": {
        "long_description": {
          "before": "Golpo AI is the world's best platform to create fully produced whiteboard explainer videos from just a prompt or document. Instead of hiring an agency, you simply input a prompt or document explaining what you want, and in minutes you get a whiteboard explainer video in a style similar to Khan Academy or RSA Animate. After creation, you have the ability to edit all aspects of the video with just prompts. \r\n\r\nIt's perfect for training, faceless YouTube, marketing, technical, and educational videos — any video where understanding is important. Trusted by over 120,000 users, Golpo features include but are not limited to: \r\n\r\n1) Convert your narration into an explainer video (with your narration as audio and the video time aligned) \r\n2) Input your document or prompt. Document can be of virtually any format or type (text, audio, video etc.) \r\n3) Script-to-video with matching audio\r\n4) Videos up to 10 minutes\r\n5) 50+ languages\r\n6) dead-simple editing after generation\r\n7) Insert your own videos and images into the generation, used as-is without alteration.\r\n8) 10+ visuals styles, including pen in hand, voice cloning, vertical video, custom branding and more! API access available. \r\n",
          "after": "Golpo AI is the world's best platform to create fully produced whiteboard explainer videos from just a prompt or document. Instead of hiring an agency, you simply input a prompt or document explaining what you want, and in minutes you get a whiteboard explainer video in a style similar to Khan Academy or RSA Animate. After creation, you have the ability to edit all aspects of the video with just prompts. \r\n\r\nIt's perfect for training, faceless YouTube, marketing, technical, and educational videos — any video where understanding is important. Trusted by over 150,000 users as of July '26, Golpo features include but are not limited to: \r\n\r\n1) Convert your narration into an explainer video (with your narration as audio and the video time aligned) \r\n2) Input your document or prompt. Document can be of virtually any format or type (text, audio, video etc.) \r\n3) Script-to-video with matching audio\r\n4) Videos up to 10 minutes\r\n5) 50+ languages\r\n6) dead-simple editing after generation\r\n7) Insert your own videos and images into the generation, used as-is without alteration.\r\n8) 10+ visuals styles, including pen in hand, voice cloning, vertical video, custom branding and more! API access available. \r\n"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30845,
      "name": "Structured AI",
      "slug": "structured-ai",
      "batch": "Fall 2025",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/structured-ai",
      "changed_fields": [
        "long_description",
        "one_liner"
      ],
      "changes": {
        "long_description": {
          "before": "Structured AI is building the AI workforce for construction design engineering, starting with AI agents that perform quality control on technical documents and drawings. Our agents learn your standards, apply the right building codes, and automatically review your drawings, so you see fewer clashes, fewer inconsistencies, and fewer costly RFIs and change orders.\r\n\r\n⚙️ Automates QA/QC across mechanical, electrical, structural and more\r\n🧩 Used by multi-disciplinary design firms to deliver projects faster with less risk\r\n🚀 Mission: Free engineers to focus on creative design, not repetitive admin",
          "after": "Structured AI is the most advanced AI-powered QA/QC platform for drawing packages, working across both PDF drawings and native Revit models. Architects and engineers use our platform to make every drawing set leave the office with certainty. \r\n\r\nOur AI agents learn your firm's standards, apply the relevant codes, and read every page of a set, then return a clear list of what's wrong, where it sits, and how to fix it. Run compliance reviews across thousands of pages in minutes, chat with your drawings for sourced answers, build custom checks in plain English, compare versions, overlay disciplines, and close out comments - all within a single platform, with a full audit trail on every finding.\r\n\r\nFor decades, the last line of defense on a drawing set has been a red pen at the end of a deadline week. But buildings have outgrown the red pen. A modern set runs thousands of drawings, and the errors hiding between them threaten quality and safety, not just cost. What manual review misses resurfaces as RFIs, change orders, and field rework, paid for in time, margin, and reputation.\r\n\r\nStructured AI catches those errors before they leave the office, capturing the judgment of your best reviewer once and applying it everywhere.\r\n\r\nBetter drawings build a better world. #GetStructured"
        },
        "one_liner": {
          "before": "AI workforce for Construction Engineering",
          "after": "The AI drawing review platform for architects and engineers."
        }
      }
    },
