        "long_description": {
          "before": "Amulet helps post-sales teams monitor every account and automate the work that drives retention and expansion.\r\n\r\nOur agents connect to customer data (CRM, support, product usage, and communication data) to flag churn risks, surface upsell opportunities, track adoption, and draft the right messages for each customer.",
          "after": "Amulet is a high-performance filesystem that gives agent workloads fast access to petabytes of data stored in the cloud. \r\n\r\nWe provide isolated, writable workspaces that mount in under 100 ms and fork without copying data. Work persists across disposable compute, and every workspace can be snapshotted, reproduced, merged, or rolled back. We’re working with agentic automated-research labs, cloud agent providers, and other to bring this infrastructure to data-intensive AI teams."
